Package: hexmon-edge
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Hexmon <noreply@hexmon.invalid>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: adduser
Description: Hexmon edge gateway agent
 Reads industrial devices (Modbus, OPC UA, BACnet, SNMP and more), buffers
 readings locally and forwards them to the Hexmon IoT platform over MQTT.
 Installs a systemd service but does not start it: edit
 /etc/hexmon/edge-agent.yaml or claim the gateway first.
